in subsection (c), by striking paragraph (2) and inserting the following:“(2)(A) The maximum rate of basic pay for any grade for a covered position may not exceed—“(i) in the case of an advanced practice nurse, the maximum rate of basic pay established for positions in level I of the Executive Schedule under section 5312 of title 5;
