by amending paragraph (1) to read as follows:“(1) any person providing legal assistance through a program funded under this section—“(A)(i) is a licensed attorney or is working under the direct supervision of a licensed attorney;
“(ii) in immigration proceedings, is a Board of Immigration Appeals accredited representative;
“(iii) in Veterans’ Administration claims, is an accredited representative; or
