and harm reduction programs for people who use substances to address domestic violence, dating violence, sexual assault, and stalking among patients the programs serve.”
;

in subsection (c)(3)(A), by striking “given to outcome based evaluations.” and inserting the following: “given to—“(i) outcome based evaluations;
